# inputs that are not ours to commit: the game, the exe, the IDA database and its exports. No trailing slash: an
# agent worktree holds these three as symlinks to the main checkout's (harness/worktree.sh), and a rule ending in `/`
# matches directories only, so `git add -A` there would commit the links; merging such a commit makes git delete the
# main checkout's ignored directory to put the link in its place.
/game
/resources
# the isolated runtime (Wine prefix, run tree, venv, tools, outputs) and builds
/env
/build/
/build-*/
__pycache__/

.idea/
.gitattributes
.vscode/